{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek a Stra\u0161ideln\u00fd hrad",
    "steam_appid": 3245310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek a stra\u0161ideln\u00fd hrad&quot; p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed legend\u00e1rn\u00ed \u010desk\u00fd komiks k \u017eivotu v \u00fachvatn\u00e9 4K grafice, kter\u00e1 zachov\u00e1v\u00e1 p\u016fvodn\u00ed um\u011bleck\u00fd styl Jaroslava N\u011bme\u010dka. P\u0159ipojte se k Fifince, My\u0161pul\u00ednovi, Pin\u010fovi a Bob\u00edkovi na nezapomenuteln\u00e9 cest\u011b na tajemn\u00fd hrad Ok\u0159\u00edn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 vlastnosti:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Za\u017eijte kouzlo \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstku v n\u00e1dhern\u00e9m 4K rozli\u0161en\u00ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Vychutnejte si ikonick\u00fd dabing v pod\u00e1n\u00ed nezapomenuteln\u00e9ho Ji\u0159\u00edho L\u00e1buse a Petra \u0160t\u011bp\u00e1nka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u0158e\u0161te h\u00e1danky a mini-hry nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d \u010dty\u0159mi vzru\u0161uj\u00edc\u00edmi epizodami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Znovu pro\u017eijte magii \u010desk\u00e9ho kulturn\u00edho fenom\u00e9nu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokonal\u00e9 pro fanou\u0161ky v\u0161ech v\u011bkov\u00fdch kategori\u00ed, tato point-and-click adventura kombinuje humor, tajemstv\u00ed a p\u0159\u00e1telstv\u00ed. Pomozte part\u011b \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstku odhalit tajemstv\u00ed stra\u0161ideln\u00e9ho hradu, interagujte s origin\u00e1ln\u00edmi postavami a vytv\u00e1\u0159ejte nezapomenuteln\u00e9 vzpom\u00ednky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u0165 u\u017e se vrac\u00edte k obl\u00edben\u00e9 h\u0159e z d\u011btstv\u00ed nebo objevujete \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek poprv\u00e9, tento remasterovan\u00fd klenot nab\u00edz\u00ed hodiny z\u00e1bavy pro celou rodinu. Nenechte si uj\u00edt tento kousek \u010desk\u00e9 hern\u00ed historie!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek a stra\u0161ideln\u00fd hrad&quot; p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed legend\u00e1rn\u00ed \u010desk\u00fd komiks k \u017eivotu v \u00fachvatn\u00e9 4K grafice, kter\u00e1 zachov\u00e1v\u00e1 p\u016fvodn\u00ed um\u011bleck\u00fd styl Jaroslava N\u011bme\u010dka. P\u0159ipojte se k Fifince, My\u0161pul\u00ednovi, Pin\u010fovi a Bob\u00edkovi na nezapomenuteln\u00e9 cest\u011b na tajemn\u00fd hrad Ok\u0159\u00edn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 vlastnosti:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Za\u017eijte kouzlo \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstku v n\u00e1dhern\u00e9m 4K rozli\u0161en\u00ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Vychutnejte si ikonick\u00fd dabing v pod\u00e1n\u00ed nezapomenuteln\u00e9ho Ji\u0159\u00edho L\u00e1buse a Petra \u0160t\u011bp\u00e1nka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u0158e\u0161te h\u00e1danky a mini-hry nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d \u010dty\u0159mi vzru\u0161uj\u00edc\u00edmi epizodami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Znovu pro\u017eijte magii \u010desk\u00e9ho kulturn\u00edho fenom\u00e9nu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dokonal\u00e9 pro fanou\u0161ky v\u0161ech v\u011bkov\u00fdch kategori\u00ed, tato point-and-click adventura kombinuje humor, tajemstv\u00ed a p\u0159\u00e1telstv\u00ed. Pomozte part\u011b \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstku odhalit tajemstv\u00ed stra\u0161ideln\u00e9ho hradu, interagujte s origin\u00e1ln\u00edmi postavami a vytv\u00e1\u0159ejte nezapomenuteln\u00e9 vzpom\u00ednky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u0165 u\u017e se vrac\u00edte k obl\u00edben\u00e9 h\u0159e z d\u011btstv\u00ed nebo objevujete \u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek poprv\u00e9, tento remasterovan\u00fd klenot nab\u00edz\u00ed hodiny z\u00e1bavy pro celou rodinu. Nenechte si uj\u00edt tento kousek \u010desk\u00e9 hern\u00ed historie!</p>",
    "short_description": "\u010cty\u0159l\u00edstek a stra\u0161ideln\u00fd hrad&quot; p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed legend\u00e1rn\u00ed \u010desk\u00fd komiks k \u017eivotu v \u00fachvatn\u00e9 4K grafice, kter\u00e1 zachov\u00e1v\u00e1 p\u016fvodn\u00ed um\u011bleck\u00fd styl Jaroslava N\u011bme\u010dka. P\u0159ipojte se k Fifince, My\u0161pul\u00ednovi, Pin\u010fovi a Bob\u00edkovi na nezapomenuteln\u00e9 cest\u011b na tajemn\u00fd hrad Ok\u0159\u00edn.",
